                         If :attr:`bias` is ``True``, then the values of these weights are
                         sampled from :math:`\mathcal{U}(-\sqrt{k}, \sqrt{k})` where
                         :math:`k = \frac{groups}{C_\text{out} * \prod_{i=0}^{1}\text{kernel\_size}[i]}`

